She filed an affidavit Ex PW1/A wherein she deposed :
(i) that at the relevant time she was travelling in the vehicle bearing registration no. DL8CV4329,
which was being driven by her son, who lost his life in an accident when their vehicle dashed into the rear of the offending vehicle, which was parked in the middle of the road without any indicators/reflectors and that she sustained serious injuries in the said accident; and that the accident took place due to the negligence of R1 in parking the offending vehicle in the middle of the Also At : H. No. 168 vs Avtar Singh on 18 April, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/102432536/
4 road;
(ii) that she was removed to CHC Hospital, Gannaur, wherefrom she was further referred to PGI Hospital Khanpur, Haryana for medical treatment;
(iii) that she was hospitalized in Shri Balaji Medical Institute, Paschim Vihar, Delhi from 16.06.2015 to 17.06.2015, in Brahm Shakti Hospital, Budh Vihar, New Delhi from 18.06.2015 to 21.06.2015 and that her medical treatment was continuing till the MACT No. 1003/18 Sumitra Devi Vs. Avtar Sing &
Ors. Pages No. 7/28 LOVLEEN Date: 2023.04.18 date of her examination as PW1;
(iv) that at the relevant time she was 54 years old and was engaged in sewing/ stitching work and she used to earn a sum of Rs. 14,000/ per month at the relevant time, but due to the injuries sustained in the accident and the permanent disability, she could not attend to her work for a period of 03 years thereby incurring financial losses;
(v) that she has incurred expenses to the tune of Rs. 1,10,388/ towards medical expenses, Rs. 2 Lakhs towards special diet, Rs. 50,000/ towards conveyance and Rs. 1 Lakh towards attendant charges.

5.2 She has relied upon following documents in support of her claim : "Ex. PW1/1(OSR) is the copy of Aadhar Card of PW1; Ex. PW1/2 are the discharge summary and treatment record of Sh.
Balaji Medical Institute;
Ex. PW1/3 are the discharge summary and treatment record of Brahm Shakti Hospital;
Ex. PW1/4 are the medical bills;
Mark X is the copy of discharge summary of Brahm Shakti Hospital."
MACT No. 1003/18 Sumitra Devi Vs. Avtar Sing & Ors.
